---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/history.css';
import { SEASONS } from '../../data/questions.mjs';
import { ORIGINAL_SITE_AUDIT } from '../../data/original-site-audit.mjs';
import { GUEST_SOCIAL_DIRECTORY } from '../../data/guest-social-directory.mjs';
import { buildReproductionAudit } from '../../lib/reproduction-audit.mjs';
import { siteRoutePath } from '../../lib/history-config.mjs';
const historyHref = siteRoutePath(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, 'history/');
const privacyHref = siteRoutePath(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, 'privacy/');
type GuestSocialAccount = { platform: string; url: string; evidence_url: string; relationship: string };
type GuestSocialPerson = { season: number; stage_name_ko: string; accounts: ReadonlyArray<GuestSocialAccount> };
const socialPeople = GUEST_SOCIAL_DIRECTORY as unknown as ReadonlyArray<GuestSocialPerson>;
const socialLinkCount = socialPeople.reduce((total, person) => total + person.accounts.length, 0);
const audit = buildReproductionAudit();
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#10131a" />
    <meta name="description" content="目标是把韩国《The Community》两季官网测试忠实译成中文，并实现同答卷同官方结果。目前可试填 124 道公开来源题，译文与官方计分仍待核验。" />
    <title>同频实验室 · The Community Lab</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 48 48'%3E%3Crect width='48' height='48' rx='13' fill='%2310131a'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='24' cy='24' r='14' fill='none' stroke='%23ff7468' stroke-width='4'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='24' cy='24' r='4' fill='%23ff7468'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
    <script>import '../../app.mjs';</script>
    <style is:global>
      .guest-social-directory{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff28}
      .guest-social-person{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff20}
      .guest-social-person strong{font-size:15px}
      .guest-social-links{display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0}
      .guest-social-links a{color:#ffb4a5;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;padding:8px 4px}
      .guest-social-links .guest-social-source{color:#c1c5ce;font-size:13px}
      .guest-social-person small{display:block;color:#aaaeb8;line-height:1.7}
      .guest-social-caveat{border-left:2px solid #ff776c;padding:2px 0 2px 18px;margin:0 0 28px;color:#c8cbd1}
      .guest-social-caveat strong{color:#f4f0e7;font-size:14px}
      .guest-social-caveat p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;margin:8px 0 0}
      .guest-social-seasons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:34px}
      .guest-social-season h3{font-size:20px;margin:0;color:#f4f0e7}
      .guest-social-season .guest-social-directory{margin-top:12px}
      .guest-social-account{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
      @media(max-width:760px){.guest-social-seasons{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="#home" aria-label="同频实验室首页">
          <span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
          <span class="brand-name">THE COMMUNITY <strong>LAB.</strong><small>同频实验室</small></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="主导航" class="header-links">
          <a href="#experiments">双季测试</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">我们的标准</a>
          <a id="history-navigation" href={historyHref} hidden>私人历史</a>
          <a href="#guest-social">嘉宾社媒</a>
          <a class="nav-github" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main id="main-content">
        <section id="home-view" class="view">
          <div class="intro-strip"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>독립 팬 프로젝트 · 独立非官方项目</span><span class="intro-separator"></span><span>实验版 0.1</span></div>
          <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
            <div class="hero-copy">
              <div class="eyebrow"><span>01 / ABOUT YOUR VALUES</span><span class="eyebrow-line"></span></div>
              <p class="hero-korean" lang="ko">당신은 누구와 가장 닮았을까요?</p>
              <h1 id="hero-title" tabindex="-1">立场不同，<br /><em>也能找到同频。</em></h1>
              <p class="hero-description">我们的目标不是另写一套测试，而是把《The Community》官网原题<span class="highlight-text">逐题信达雅地翻译成中文</span>，最终做到<strong>同一份答案、同一份官网结果</strong>。目前可以试填两季共 124 道公开来源题；AI 初译还需真人韩中复核，官方计分尚未核实，因此暂时只保存本机答题记录。</p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href={`${base}questionnaire/?season=2`} class="button button-primary">试填第二季 37 题 · 非官方 AI 初译 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                <button id="hero-start" class="button button-outline" type="button">另看 6 道本站原创演示 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
              </div>
              <p class="safe-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span> 试填的是公开来源题的 AI 初译；真人韩中复核目前为 0/124，不能获得官方分数。第二个按钮是独立创作示例；两者都未通过官方等价验收。</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="hero-art" aria-labelledby="hero-axis-caption">
              <div class="hero-art-visual" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="art-caption art-caption-top">THE COMMUNITY / VALUES INDEX</div>
                <div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="orb orb-three"></div>
                <div class="orb-center"><span>第二季</span><strong>价值轴</strong><small>示意图</small></div>
                <span class="art-pin pin-one">01</span>
                <span class="art-pin pin-two">02</span>
                <span class="art-pin pin-three">03</span>
              </div>
              <figcaption class="hero-axis-caption" id="hero-axis-caption">
                <p><strong>第二季的三个价值维度</strong><span>示意图 · 不代表个人结果</span></p>
                <ul class="hero-axis-list" aria-label="三个价值轴">
                  <li><span class="axis-number">01</span>原则 <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span> 结果</li>
                  <li><span class="axis-number">02</span>结构 <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span> 能力</li>
                  <li><span class="axis-number">03</span>意义 <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span> 实利</li>
                </ul>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </section>

          <section class="section experiments" id="experiments" aria-labelledby="experiments-title">
            <div class="section-topline"><span>01 — SELECT YOUR SEASON</span><span>두 개의 시즌 / 两季入口</span></div>
            <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="experiments-title">从哪一季开始？</h2><p>推荐先试填两季共 124 道公开客户端原题；下方 8＋6 道为本站早期独立演示，用于验证交互。原题中文为未经真人复核的 AI 初译，不提供官方分数或嘉宾匹配。</p></div><span class="section-count">02 <small>TESTS</small></span></div>
            <div class="season-grid">
              <article class="season-card season-two"><div class="season-meta"><span class="chip chip-accent">优先开发</span><span>SEASON 02 / 2026</span></div><div class="season-number">02<span>.</span></div><div class="season-body"><p class="season-korean" lang="ko">보이지 않는 손</p><h3>第二季 · 看不见的手</h3><p>原则与结果，结构与能力，意义与实利。三个坐标，看看你如何取舍。</p></div><div class="season-footer"><span>3 组价值轴 <i>·</i> 6 道原创演示题</span><button id="start-s2" class="season-arrow" type="button" aria-label="开始第二季演示测试"><span>开始</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><p id="s2-session-note" class="session-note" hidden></p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href={`${base}questionnaire/?season=2`}>本站非官方试填 · 37 道公开题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="source-site" href="https://the-community-survey.web.app/season/2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">另去韩文原站完成 37 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
              <article class="season-card season-one"><div class="season-meta"><span class="chip">同步预览</span><span>SEASON 01 / 2024</span></div><div class="season-number">01<span>.</span></div><div class="season-body"><p class="season-korean" lang="ko">더 커뮤니티</p><h3>第一季 · 价值观探索</h3><p>公共参与、性别观念、阶级分配与开放性。四个角度，看见差异。</p></div><div class="season-footer"><span>4 组价值轴 <i>·</i> 8 道原创演示题</span><button id="start-s1" class="season-arrow" type="button" aria-label="开始第一季演示测试"><span>开始</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><p id="s1-session-note" class="session-note" hidden></p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href={`${base}questionnaire/?season=1`}>本站非官方试填 · 87 道公开题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="source-site" href="https://the-community-survey.web.app/season/1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">另去韩文原站完成 87 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
            </div>
            <section aria-labelledby="source-pilot-heading" class="mt-8 border border-[#ff776c]/55 bg-[#261e22] p-6 md:p-9">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs tracking-widest text-[#ffb4a5]"><span>NEW / 124 QUESTIONS</span><span class="rounded-full border border-[#ff776c]/55 px-3 py-1 tracking-normal">非官方原题试填 · AI 初译</span></div>
              <h3 id="source-pilot-heading" class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#f4f0e7] md:text-3xl">向忠实中文版迈出的第一步：两季原题已可试填。</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-8 text-[#c6c3c6]">我们将当前公开客户端中可见的第一季 87 题、第二季 37 题，按已观察到的题序接入了独立页面。每题韩文在上、中文初译在下，选项也逐一对应。用户报告的非营利翻译许可原件未由项目独立核验；译文尚未经过人工审校，官方服务端计分仍未知。完成后可下载自己的本机答题记录，但不会生成冒充官方的成绩。</p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <a href={`${base}questionnaire/?season=2`} class="button button-primary">试填第二季 37 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
                <a href={`${base}questionnaire/?season=1`} class="button button-outline">试填第一季 87 题 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs leading-6 text-[#c6c3c6]">无需注册 · 答案不上传 · 刷新即清空 · 不等同官方测试或正式译文</p>
            </section>
            <section aria-labelledby="audit-heading" class="mt-10 border border-white/15 bg-[#171c23] p-5 md:p-7">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <h3 id="audit-heading" class="m-0 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#f4f0e7]">原题资料核验进度</h3>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-[#ff776c]/50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-[#ffb4a5]">公开的核验账本 · 非官方</span>
              </div>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#b6bbc5]">已定位两季公开客户端里的源题标识。用户报告已获当前公开材料的官方非营利翻译许可，许可原件未独立核验；正式译文与官方计分仍待核验，演示题单独计数。</p>
              <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
                {Object.values(SEASONS).map(season => (
                  <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#101319] p-4">
                    <span class="text-xs tracking-widest text-[#ffb4a5]">SEASON 0{season.id}</span>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[#f4f0e7]">韩文原站显示 <strong class="text-xl">{ORIGINAL_SITE_AUDIT[season.id as 1 | 2].observedQuestionCount}</strong> 题</p>
                    <dl class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-[#b6bbc5]">
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>已定位源题标识</dt><dd>{audit.rows.find(row => row.season === season.id)?.observedSourceIdentityCount} 条</dd></div>
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>获准且独立复核的原题</dt><dd>{audit.rows.find(row => row.season === season.id)?.licensedReviewedOfficialQuestionCount} 道</dd></div>
                      <div class="flex justify-between gap-3"><dt>本站原创演示题</dt><dd>{season.questions.length} 道</dd></div>
                    </dl>
                    <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#ffb4a5]">官方题库完整性：未验收 · 官方评分一致性：未验收</p>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <details class="mt-5 border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#b6bbc5]">
                <summary class="cursor-pointer text-[#f4f0e7]">查看逐题来源与尚缺的证据</summary>
                <p class="mt-3">索引记录了 87＋37 个源题标识、所属维度、选项数量及客户端资源指纹，不包含原题题干或选项文字。源数组位置不等于答题时的展示顺序；非连续标识也不等于漏题。</p>
                <p class="mt-2">核对日期：2026-10-29。第一季当前客户端混用六级与四级选项；本站演示仍是独立四级量表。用户报告已获当前公开材料的官方非营利翻译许可，原件未独立核验；源站与题库版本归属、独立人工韩中审校及服务端评分金标准仍待核实。</p>
                <a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/data/original-question-index.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">逐题来源与缺口清单 ↗</a>
              </details>
              <a class="mt-5 inline-flex text-sm text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href="https://github.com/mykcs/the-community-lab/blob/main/docs/VERIFICATION-MATRIX.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看每一道验证关卡与证据 →</a>
              <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b6bbc5]">逐题查看、修改草稿可使用公开译审台：124 题、550 个选项。想实际作答则可使用上方的独立原题试填页。两者都不是已经独立审校的正式测试。</p>
              <a class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href="https://mykcs.github.io/the-community-lab/translation-review/">打开 124 题韩中复核台 ↗</a>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b6bbc5]">需要逐项校对原题与选项时，也可打开独立复核工具；修改保存在当前设备，不代表已通过人工审校。</p>
              <a class="mt-2 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-[#ffb4a5] underline underline-offset-4" href={`${base}original-question-translation-review/`}>打开原题逐项复核工具 ↗</a>
            </section>
          </section>

          <section class="section guest-social-section" id="guest-social" aria-labelledby="guest-social-title">
            <div class="section-topline"><span>02 — PUBLIC SOCIAL LINKS</span><span>公开来源 · 仅供导航</span></div>
            <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="guest-social-title">嘉宾公开来源中的社媒链接</h2><p>无需完成测试即可查看。以下 {socialPeople.length} 位嘉宾、{socialLinkCount} 条链接按季整理；两名独立 Agent 逐条核对了公开来源，尚未经真人逐条复核。</p></div><span class="section-count">{socialLinkCount} <small>LINKS</small></span></div>
            <aside class="guest-social-caveat" aria-label="社媒目录核查范围">
              <strong>核查范围与限制</strong>
              <p>这些链接只供导航，不代表嘉宾成绩、匹配、排名或近期活跃度已核实，也不构成法律身份认证。Instagram 页面未直接读取；只核对了公开来源中发布的链接。共同频道会单独标明。</p>
            </aside>
            <div class="guest-social-seasons">
              {[1, 2].map(seasonId => (
                <section class="guest-social-season" aria-labelledby={`guest-social-season-${seasonId}`}>
                  <h3 id={`guest-social-season-${seasonId}`}>第 {seasonId} 季</h3>
                  <ul class="guest-social-directory">
                    {socialPeople.filter(person => person.season === seasonId).map(person => (
                      <li class="guest-social-person">
                        <strong>{person.stage_name_ko}</strong>
                        <div class="guest-social-links">
                          {person.accounts.map(account => (
                            <span class="guest-social-account">
                              <a href={account.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${person.stage_name_ko} 的公开 ${account.platform}${account.relationship === 'co_hosted_channel' ? '共同频道' : '主页'}链接`}>
                                {account.platform}{account.relationship === 'co_hosted_channel' ? '（共同频道）' : ''} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                              </a>
                              <a class="guest-social-source" href={account.evidence_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${person.stage_name_ko} 的 ${account.platform} 链接核查来源`}>
                                核查来源
                              </a>
                            </span>
                          ))}
                        </div>
                        <small>两名独立 Agent 核对公开原始来源 · 2026-10-29 · 待真人逐条复核</small>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                </section>
              ))}
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="section principle-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
            <div class="section-topline"><span>03 — OUR APPROACH</span><span>한글 × 中文</span></div>
            <h2 id="principles-title">一份好翻译，<br />让立场被真正听见。</h2>
            <div class="principle-grid"><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">01 / 原文</span><strong lang="ko">한국어 원문</strong><p>每道题先放韩文，保留关键条件、否定和语气，方便懂韩语的人逐句核对。</p></div><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">02 / 中文</span><strong>信 · 达 · 雅</strong><p>以忠于原义、清楚自然为目标，不替题目改立场。本站原创示例译文尚待独立韩中复核。</p></div><div class="principle-item"><span class="principle-index">03 / 证据</span><strong>来源可核验</strong><p>区分本站原创题与节目原题；嘉宾成绩、社媒链接也必须有可靠的公开证据。</p></div></div>
          </section>

          <section class="vision-banner"><div><span class="eyebrow-plain">MATCHING / 等待成绩核验</span><h2>公开社媒链接已开放，<br />真实匹配仍待核验。</h2><p>节目原题、计分方式与嘉宾成绩达到同版本核验标准后，才会开放 3–5 位同季嘉宾匹配。当前目录只作导航，不会把原创演示结果与嘉宾成绩比较。</p></div><div class="vision-symbol" aria-hidden="true">≋<span>YOU × CAST</span></div></section>
        </section>

        <section id="quiz-view" class="view quiz-view" hidden aria-labelledby="quiz-heading">
          <div class="quiz-header"><button id="quiz-exit" class="back-button" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 返回入口 / 暂停</button><div class="quiz-top-marker" id="quiz-season-label">SEASON 02</div></div>
          <div class="quiz-progress-info"><span id="quiz-count">第 01 / 06 题</span><span id="quiz-percent" aria-live="polite">已答 0 / 6 题</span></div><progress id="quiz-progress" class="progress-track" value="0" max="6" aria-label="已答题目进度"></progress>
